WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.700
Ask HR anything. And get an answer you can check.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:19.290
People teams are buried. CVs in many languages. Interview recordings nobody re-plays. Scanned forms, typed in by hand. And attrition, seen only after the resignation.

3
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:34.850
So we built a team of AI specialists. One question goes in. Triage sends it to the right experts: policy, talent, workforce and retention. Then a compliance review checks the answer, before anyone sees it.

4
00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:40.210
Let's spend a day with an HR business partner.

5
00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.160
Priya signs in with her work account.

6
00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.470
Her home screen shows the numbers that matter, live from the HR records.

7
00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:09.700
Everything the team can do is one click away. She asks a policy question. The specialists get to work, and the answer arrives with its source, and a compliance approval.

8
00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:29.160
Next, a question about her people. The numbers are read live from the records. Never guessed.

9
00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:57.320
Now, something unfair. Can we screen out older applicants, or other nationalities? The answer is no. And it quotes the recruitment policy.

10
00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:16.690
She drops in a scanned onboarding form.

11
00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:29.550
It is recognised, read by AI, checked against the employee record, and filed. No retyping.

12
00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:46.790
Behind the scenes, every question travels to the right specialists, and through the compliance review.

13
00:02:56.130 --> 00:03:00.600
And every document lands exactly where it belongs.

14
00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:14.590
That is hours back, every single week.

15
00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:27.510
Every answer comes from your own data. Your records. Your documents. Your policies.

16
00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:36.780
And people stay in charge. Sources are shown. Every reply is reviewed. Personal details are protected.

17
00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:43.150
The same blueprint works for any department. Only the data changes.

18
00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:49.570
Train. Innovate. Build. Tell us about your process.
